{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not let subsequent cleanup hide an already-observed JVM fatal.** After recording a fatal here, the loop synchronously invokes every remaining end hook. If an earlier hook blocks, the caller never observes the fatal and the invocation times out. Race the fatal into the invocation result immediately and bound any remaining best-effort cleanup; add a regression with a fatal inner hook and blocked outer hook.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QxWl","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":116,"observation_digest":"dae7b573aa3fb38689420d25d331cec671421ae917853eda5bab5935bdddea05","observation_id":"aro_v1_3lt3k45kh6zynckcbus5gmooyz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:17Z","review_id":"arr_v1_u5vqjkgdlfisimzhmtii6vlizn","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7adb5a65e5e91e736325ca7e73781e22bfcf8a7e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_4frmk54eym6tpurskg2zkyivvl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:10:17Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
